@verbs spells magic hechizos formular esferas escuelas
@tier player
@title the spells you know and how to cast them

Only the magic guilds teach spells; if you do not belong to one,
these four verbs have nothing to tell you. They are not translated
yet:

  hechizos                      lists the ones you know.
  formular <spell> [<target>]   casts one.

Casting takes time: there is a round of preparation, and you cannot
start another one until the first has finished. You cannot cast
while dead either, nor wearing armour your guild does not allow.

  esferas     the spheres your guild gave you, if it is clerical.
  escuelas    the schools, if your guild is a mage guild.

A guild uses one of the two, not both: the other verb answers that
you do not need it.
